+// Motion (gyro) aiming: the controller's gyroscope adds to the right stick, so
+// turning or tilting the console (or the right Joy-Con, or a Pro Controller) moves the camera and the aim.
+// Rotation about the gravity axis turns the camera; tilting it about its own left-right axis looks up and down.
+// 0 = off, 1 = while aiming (ZL held), 2 = always on.
+// By default, always active while aiming (ZL held).
+REXCVAR_DEFINE_INT32(input_gyro, 1, "Input",
+                     "Gyro aiming: 0 = off, 1 = while ZL (aim / zoom) is held, 2 = always")
